‘Higher minimum wages now – anyone who works full-time must be able to live on their earnings!’ {{1}}
‘Fewer forms, more workbenches: finally free our businesses from unnecessary bureaucracy!’ {{2}}
‘New study: longer shop opening hours harm retail staff's health.’ {{3}}
‘Save the after-work beer – no to the planned drinks levy!’, launched by the drinks manufacturers' association. {{4}}
‘One in four toy drones tested fails the safety test – we demand compulsory testing.’ {{5}}
‘The planned business park threatens the region's last wetland – stop the development!’ {{6}}
‘Subscription traps in fitness apps: we demand understandable contracts and a simple right to cancel.’ {{7}}
‘Lower energy levies for our industry – or jobs will move abroad.’ {{8}}
‘More night trains instead of short-haul flights: sign for climate-friendly travel!’ {{9}}
‘Four extra days of holiday for all employees – rest is a right, not a reward.’ {{10}}
